The kernel modules in this directory are third-party software, not part of the
lmepisowifi project's own AGPLv3 code:

  xt_hl.ko    Xtables "ttl"/"hl" match   (Linux kernel net/netfilter/xt_hl.c)
  xt_HL.ko    Xtables "TTL"/"HL" target  (Linux kernel net/netfilter/xt_HL.c)

They are built from the Linux kernel and retain their original license. This
NOTICE stands in for a source-file header (the artifacts are compiled kernel
objects and cannot carry one). Being shipped in this repository, or in the
release tarballs next to the AGPLv3 scripts that insmod them, does not
relicense them: they are separate works, loaded into the kernel on demand by
lmehspt.sh (anti-tether).

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

