Build
-----
  Built for the Realtek RTL9607C vendor kernel: Linux 4.4.140, SMP,
  mod_unload, MIPS32r2, 32-bit, big-endian (see `vermagic` in each .ko).

Corresponding source (GPL-2.0 section 3)
----------------------------------------
  Upstream source of the files above, as of Linux v4.4.140:
    https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/tree/net/netfilter/xt_hl.c?h=v4.4.140
    https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/tree/net/netfilter/xt_HL.c?h=v4.4.140

  The modules correspond to the vendor's GPLv2 kernel source release
  described under "GPLv2 dump status" in README.md.

  Written offer: for at least three years from the date of each release that
  contains these binaries, anyone who has received them may obtain the
  complete corresponding source for them, on a medium customarily used for
  software interchange, for no more than the cost of performing the
